{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/202646us6Wn0mi1793268319.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>「卜卜脆」羅皓誼早前前往韓國旅遊，近日於社交平台上載了一系列在當地拍攝的韓服靚相，與粉絲分享旅遊點滴。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"7662970c-6089-441e-9d5a-643798705554.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026yuZDvnvRRZ1793268318.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p></p><p>照片中，羅皓誼身穿一襲粉白配色的古典韓服，配搭精緻的髮飾，整體造型唯美大方。她於知名景點景福宮前留影，時而端莊靜坐，時而輕撫裙擺，展現出清純典雅的氣質與甜美笑容，獲得不少網民留言大讚靚女。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"ff2cadf8-ab8e-4d5e-9923-097349abbb5b.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/20267NHqtUevtu1793268318.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T10:42:10.709836+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":146,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T10:04:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T14:39:20.745587+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T10:38:26.144962+00:00","content_hash":"3d8d66884fe1bf2009e8e3e2b9fd95ee97eeed25593eeb698574062d47593d89","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}